# ==============================================================================
# GitHub Linguist Dynamic Language Vocabulary Prompts for Whisper Speech-to-Text
# ==============================================================================
# This configuration contains initial_prompt strings for ALL programming languages
# recognized by GitHub Linguist (570+ programming languages + markup & data formats).
# Sourced by scripts/dictate.sh to bias Whisper token probabilities and eliminate
# domain homophones during IDE voice dictation.
#
# Variable convention: PROMPT_<SANITIZED_EXTENSION_OR_LANGUAGE_NAME>
# Fallback: PROMPT_DEFAULT
# ==============================================================================

# --- 1C Enterprise ---
PROMPT_BSL="1C Enterprise, function, class, struct, method, variable, parameter, return, import, module, if, else, loop, string, integer, boolean"
